# PX4 v1.14 parameter file for indoor Starling 2 / VOXL flight with Vicon pose input.
# Load with QGroundControl: Vehicle Setup > Parameters > Tools > Load from file.
#
# Assumptions:
# - MAVROS converts the ROS ENU Vicon pose to PX4 NED.
# - The Vicon object pose includes position and orientation, but not measured velocity.
# - The Vicon object origin is colocated with the PX4 vehicle reference point.
# - GPS and magnetometer use are intentionally disabled for indoor Vicon flight.
# - Load this after any QVIO parameter profile so these values remain authoritative.
#
# Vehicle-Id Component-Id Name Value Type
1	1	SYS_HAS_GPS	0	6
1	1	SYS_HAS_MAG	0	6
1	1	COM_ARM_WO_GPS	1	6
1	1	EKF2_AID_MASK	0	6
1	1	EKF2_EV_CTRL	11	6
1	1	EKF2_HGT_REF	3	6
1	1	EKF2_GPS_CTRL	0	6
1	1	EKF2_BARO_CTRL	1	6
1	1	EKF2_OF_CTRL	0	6
1	1	EKF2_RNG_CTRL	0	6
1	1	EKF2_MAG_TYPE	5	6
1	1	EKF2_EV_DELAY	0.0	9
